<title>DUBAI: UK warship calls on Saudi port of Jubail.</title>
<headline>UK warship calls on Saudi port of Jubail.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British aircraft carrier HMS Invincible called on Saudi Arabia's eastern port of Jubail on Sunday, a British embassy official in Riyadh said.</p>
<p>The vessel, touring the Gulf Arab region to conduct a series of training exercises with allied navies in the area, including the United States, would leave the Saudi port on Tuesday, the official told Reuters by the telephone.</p>
<p>It has visited several United Arab Emirates ports and Kuwait.</p>
</text>
